#* {{Q|la|Virgil|Aeneid|4|219|thru=220|quote=Tālibus ōrantem dictīs ārāsque tenentem / '''audiit''' omnipotēns, [...].|trans=[King Iarbas,] praying with such words as he had spoken, and [as he was] grasping the holy altars [in supplication], the Almighty [Father] '''heard''' him, [...].}}
